    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a good start. for the part about modern financial mechanisms, could you give me some specific talking points or a summary of the \"mechanics\" i can use? like, i want the students to really grasp how these systemic barriers actually work in practice today so they see it's not just a thing of the past.",
